# The single pin. Consumed as BOTH the knock container tag and the git ref the
# example policies are checked out at, so the binary and the policies can never
# disagree — the visitor verifies the exact file the docs site publishes.
#
# 0.9.3 carries the three fixes this showcase surfaced by running for real:
# path-namespaced registry hosts (GHCR wants the owner as the first path segment),
# skipping the referrers-fallback `sha256-<hex>` tags GHCR forces clients to write,
# and keyless signing working with no Fulcio/Rekor URL configured.
#
# renovate: datasource=docker depName=ghcr.io/trivoallan/knock
KNOCK_VERSION=0.9.3
